jobs.description:
We're looking for a skilled and organized Digital Project Manager to join our team full-time. You'll oversee digital advertising projects, coordinate with PPC specialists, and ensure top-quality results delivered for our clients.

Your Responsibilities:

Act as the main contact for clients, ensuring smooth communication and project updates;
Oversee and maintain the quality of Google and Meta Ads campaigns;
Collaborate with PPC specialists, copywriters, designers, and developers to meet project goals;
Develop accurate project estimates, timelines, and deliverables;
Lead onboarding meetings with clients and internal teams;
Prepare project proposals, adjust advertising strategies, and create comprehensive reports;
Manage project tasks and timelines using Asana;
Ensure accurate and timely invoicing for delivered services;

What we expect from you:

A motivated and detail-oriented individual with a passion for learning and growth;
Great social and communication skills;
Strong ownership and decision-making skills;
Analytical thinking to assess campaign results;
Confidence in making bold suggestions;
Ability to multitask, excellent time management, and attention to details;
Fluent in Lithuanian and have a good understanding of English;
Have no fear of failing;
At least 3 work days per week from office in Vilnius;

It would be a plus:

Experience with Google and Meta Ads;
2+ years experience in digital marketing or other project management roles;

Our offer:

Access to free e-learning and knowledge-sharing platforms for professional growth;
Training and full support from a Mentor while learning all ins and outs of digital project management;
Interesting Lithuanian and international projects that open up broad opportunities for self-realization;
An inspiring team of outstanding professionals;
Salary starts from 2.500 EUR/month gross;
Additional performance-based bonus system;

Additional benefits:

Flexible work conditions with the possibility to work remotely;
Up-to-date working methods, best practices, and top-notch technologies;
Holiday days off and up to 2 trusted sick days;
Free gym subscription of your choice;
Private health insurance after one year of employment.

